    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Well, we do. Breaking news that I'm literally just learning. I just came off the House floor where I had been managing the bill, the Born Alive Protection Prevention Act. And we were just successful in passing that off of the House floor as Republicans, obviously, Senate over the Senate. We'll see what they do that over there. But very, very good day for moving that important piece of legislation this week. But then, in addition, obviously, talking about the Face Act repeal, In our efforts, my joint with Mike Lee in the Senate, we've got the president issuing pardons to pro-lifers that are targeted by the weaponized Department of Justice of the Biden administration. I don't really have the full count. I think it's a one, two, three, four, five, six, seven. It looks like maybe nine or 10 people that were pardoned. A number of individuals that I've gotten to know personally talk to them individually or their families. like Lauren Handy, for example, who is a progressive activist. She just is a pro-life individual who was then sentenced to jail for 57 months.",
