    "turn_text": "Amazing to think about the stories that you've just told, and there are so many out there who have been victims of this. That's why your repeal act is so very important. You reintroduced it. You have a good feeling that it's going to move in the House. Where do you think it stands? Ultimately, will it arrive on the President's desk?",
